0,Music of the Democratic Republic of the Congo - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_the_Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo,"June 1, 2026 - Congolese popular music developed alongside the urban growth of Léopoldville (now Kinshasa) in the 1930s and the expansion of colonial commercial enterprises, which exposed local musicians to global genres such as Cuban rumba, jazz, blues, biguine, highlife, and bolero.",Pam,Niger-Congo
1,Music of the Republic of the Congo - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_the_Republic_of_the_Congo,"May 13, 2025 - The Democratic Republic of the Congo's homegrown pop music, soukous, is popular across the border, and musicians from both countries have fluidly travelled throughout the region playing similarly styled music, including Nino Malapet and Jean Serge Essous.",Pam,Niger-Congo
2,Niger | PAM - Pan African Music,https://pan-african-music.com/en/location/niger/,"... The self-taught Nigerien artist Moussa Tchingou is back with Tamiditine, an opus of four majestic tracks, carried by the riffs of Tuareg guitars and tales with universal messages.",Pam,Niger-Congo
3,Congo-Kinshasa | PAM - Pan African Music,https://pan-african-music.com/en/location/congo-kinshasa/,"The label Wald Level Records embellishes its young catalog with a beautiful third single. PAM invites you to dive into the universe of Blaqface with his new track “THC”. Originally from Goma, DRC, Makombe Samuel […]",Pam,Niger-Congo
4,congo | PAM - Pan African Music,https://pan-african-music.com/en/tag/congo/,"PAM Magazine - Design by Trafik - Site by Moonshine - All rights reserved. IDOL MEDIA, a division of IDOL Group. ... A time capsule of 1980’s Congo, the Balka Sound compilation, available November 11th, gathers the best from the eponymous genre and group, led by grand ngomfi master Nbiki “Lusialala” Albert.",Pam,Niger-Congo
5,Congo Rumba | PAM - Pan African Music,https://pan-african-music.com/en/tag/congo-rumba/,"Two years after PAM told you about The Rumba Kings the film is finally being released. The DOXA festival in Vancouver has selected the film and will screen it on 6th May. ... SLM Libende Boyz launch their EP campaign with a new video in the vain of Pablo Escobar, full of dance, lawlessness, and the contagious rhythms of Congolese rumba.",Pam,Niger-Congo
6,Niger-Congo Music Acts For Hire (Jul 2026) | Get Prices,https://acemusicbookingagency.com/niger-congo-music/,"3 days ago - It's quick and easy to get prices from musicians performing music in languages of Southern and Eastern Africa (Tanzania, Nigeria, Zimbabwe, South Africa, Malawi, Rwanda, Kenya, Namibia, Botswana regions). Request quotes from Niger-Congo musicians to book the live music that fits your needs and budget, even on last minute.",Pam,Niger-Congo
7,Paris c’est l’Afrique: Between Congo and Zaire (episode 4),https://pan-african-music.com/en/paris-cest-lafrique-between-congo-and-zaire-episode-4/,"January 3, 2023 - They’ve just established the Loketo band alongside Aurlus Mabélé. This was at the end of the ’80s, and the river Seine had the colors of several African rivers running through it: Senegal, Niger, Cameroon’s Wouri, Ivory Coast’s Bandama and of course the Congo!",Pam,Niger-Congo
8,Congo-Brazzaville | PAM - Pan African Music,https://pan-african-music.com/en/location/congo-brazzaville/,"The Congolese rapper has released a cut from Na Zala Zala, his debut album alongside The Congo Techno Ensemble, slated for a July 16 release. Nyege Nyege Tapes is the debut album from Rey Sapienz […] ... Two years after PAM told you about ...",Pam,Niger-Congo
9,PAM - Pan African Music | Un média consacré aux cultures d’Afrique et de sa diaspora.,https://pan-african-music.com/en/,"PAM sat down with King Ayisoba surrounded by his usual entourage at the “Africa Spot” in Accra’s Ablekuma district where the artist broke down his life, how he has adapted to the times and his latest project, Work Hard.",Pam,Niger-Congo
